flowchart LR
 A([Submit Article]):::trigger --> B{Has URL?}:::control
 B -->|yes| C[HTTP Fetch]:::tool --> D[Extract Text]:::det
 B -->|no| E[Use Pasted Text]:::det
 D --> F[Validate &amp; Prepare]:::det
 E --> F
 F --> G[Chunk Source<br/>MAP fan-out]:::det
 G --> H[Summarizer · per chunk<br/>AI 1]:::ai --> I[Parse Chunk]:::det --> J[Merge Chunks<br/>REDUCE]:::det
 J --> K[Synthesize<br/>AI 2]:::ai --> L[Parse &amp; Validate]:::det --> M{Retry?}:::control
 M -->|invalid| K
 M -->|valid| N[Inject Test Claim]:::det
 N --> O[Verifier<br/>AI 3]:::ai --> P[Score &amp; Route<br/>weighted · 3-tier]:::det --> Q{Route by Tier}:::control
 Q -->|HARD| R[Gmail Approve/Reject]:::human --> S[Apply Decision]:::det --> V[Build Report]:::det
 Q -->|LIGHT| T[Light Notice]:::det --> V
 Q -->|AUTO| U[Auto-Published]:::det --> V
 V --> W[Log Sheet]:::tool --> X[Email]:::tool --> Y([Show Result]):::trigger

 classDef ai fill:#7c3aed,stroke:#4c1d95,color:#fff,stroke-width:2px;
 classDef det fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0369a1,color:#0c4a6e;
 classDef control fill:#fde68a,stroke:#b45309,color:#7c2d12;
 classDef tool fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#15803d,color:#14532d;
 classDef human fill:#fecaca,stroke:#b91c1c,color:#7f1d1d,stroke-width:2px;
 classDef trigger fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#475569,color:#1e293b;
